<title>GERMANY: Strabag says four-mnth orders, output fall.</title>
<headline>Strabag says four-mnth orders, output fall.</headline>
<dateline>COLOGNE, Germany 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>German construction firm Strabag Bau AG said on Wednesday that while its results improved in the first four months of 1997, its orders were down 11 percent and output down nine percent on year-earlier levels.</p>
</text>
